Launched in 1985 the Commodore Amiga boasted graphics capabilities that were unsurpassed for
it's time.

It featured an intricate collection of custom chips that enabled it to do things that, until
then, had been impossible to achieve with other personal computers.

This site is dedicated to graphics made with or for the Commodore Amiga home computer.

Articles

Comparison

Cyber Assault 556

Display Technology

